    {
      "id": "d-YZ7DyiEi2JQ9fJbY9PB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 503.3003778317716,
      "y": 9071.378335292284,
      "width": 1326.599365234375,
      "height": 180.00000000000173,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bac",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1351139022,
      "version": 282,
      "versionNonce": 424091662,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730614065407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now this will mount the bodyParser.json() globally \nso  every time when new request comes from the client side ,server \nwill get reloaded and the body of request object will be updated\nwith new value ",
      "fontSize": 36.00000000000035,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now this will mount the bodyParser.json() globally \nso  every time when new request comes from the client side ,server \nwill get reloaded and the body of request object will be updated\nwith new value ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zk7-ImWHsNjOyq333ZcBz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -568.5982752014652,
      "y": 10075.344864069466,
      "width": 1801.9990234375,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bad",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1165190546,
      "version": 302,
      "versionNonce": 2104123086,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730614507121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So we can mount the middleware globally as well as for a perticular route or endpoint let's\nsee it with a example,suppose we create a simple put and post api endpoint which will\npush new user data into a in memory array and update it using put method",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So we can mount the middleware globally as well as for a perticular route or endpoint let's\nsee it with a example,suppose we create a simple put and post api endpoint which will\npush new user data into a in memory array and update it using put method",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
