      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So we have created a middleware fetchIndexPar() using the req,res \nglobal object with the core functionality that were using \nin put , patch and delete route for validation\n\nnow the problem is req,res are global object but the fetchIndex\nvalue which we need is now a local variable of fetchIndexPar()\nmiddleware function\n\nand we need that fetchIndexPar in put , patch ,delete route \nto get user access",
      "fontSize": 50.4345157335425,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So we have created a middleware fetchIndexPar() using the req,res \nglobal object with the core functionality that were using \nin put , patch and delete route for validation\n\nnow the problem is req,res are global object but the fetchIndex\nvalue which we need is now a local variable of fetchIndexPar()\nmiddleware function\n\nand we need that fetchIndexPar in put , patch ,delete route \nto get user access",
